---
layout: null
permalink: /search.json
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
Full-text index for js/search.js: every post's rendered body as plain text.
Jekyll renders posts before pages, so post.content is already HTML here.
{%- endcomment -%}
[
{%- for post in site.posts %}
{%- capture post_date %}{% include date-uk.html date=post.date %}{% endcapture %}
  {
    "title": {{ post.title | jsonify }},
    "date": {{ post_date | strip | jsonify }},
    "url": {{ post.url | jsonify }},
    "text": {{ post.content | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | jsonify }}
  }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
{%- endfor %}
]
